# /proposals/ — hidden client proposal pages, same privacy model as the
# welcome guide: <meta robots noindex,nofollow>, robots.txt Disallow,
# unguessable slug-based URL, not linked from the public site. These
# need to be tracked + deployed so Vercel can serve them. If a proposal
# contains anything truly sensitive, keep it as a Google Doc instead.

